{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>ערות בת בנך או בת בתך</b> etc. From where [do we know the prohibition regarding] his daughter? It is derived from הנה — הנה is written here regarding the flesh that comes from her: ״ערות אשה ובתה לא תגלה, את בת בנה ואת בת בתה לא תקח לגלות ערותה שארה הנה זמה היא,״ and the flesh that comes from him is also written here: ״ערות בת בנך או בת בתך לא תגלה ערותן כי ערותך הנה.״ Just as there, regarding the flesh that comes from her, He warned about her daughter and her son's daughter, so too here, regarding the flesh that comes from him, He warned about his daughter and his daughter's daughter, etc. Chapter אלו הן הנשרפין."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:10.240398790Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}